<title>USA: Glacier raises qtly payout 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Glacier raises qtly payout 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KALISPELL, Mont. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glacier Bancorp Inc said its board of directors raised its quarterly dividend by 12.5 percent to $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 25, to holders of record July 11..</p>
</text>
